abstract: >-
  Document conversion from one Python backend. Web UI + REST API + WeChat mini-program, ~20 source/target pairs (PDF, DOCX, XLSX, PPTX, Markdown, HTML, images, data). LibreOffice / Pandoc / Pillow / WeasyPrint under the hood, JWT + 2FA + S3 + webhooks around it.
